            category: "Purple raspberry cultivars for Ontario",
            description: "The fruit are very large, purple, firm and have a sweet flavour. Canes tend to be sparse but very vigorous and winter-hardy. This variety is resistant to two types of aphids that are known to transmit virus diseases. This should extend the productive life of the planting. It has shown excellent promise in limited Ontario trials"
